# name: test/sql/jit/test_jit_join_shape_sweep.test_slow
# description: Plain join, DISTINCT and GROUP BY shapes over TPC-H SF1 at the default cost model: compiled results
# group: [jit]

#              match jit_policy='off'. TPC-H's own queries never reached the elided pre-join projection path that seven
#              of these crashed on

